---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Happy Feet Spa — About Us"
  description="Our story, our commitment, and what we offer at Happy Feet Spa in Kansas City."
  activeNav="about"
>
  <main>
    <!-- OUR STORY -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap intro-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
          <h1>Our Story</h1>
          <p class="lead">Happy Feet Spa opened its doors in 2011 in Kansas City, built around a simple idea: foot reflexology and traditional Chinese therapy, done well, in a clean and comfortable space.</p>
          <p class="body-copy">Since then, we've grown into a senior therapist team with well over a decade of combined experience, here to give every guest in Kansas City a reliable, welcoming place for reflexology and traditional Chinese therapy.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="intro-photo" src="/images/about-room.png" alt="Treatment room at Happy Feet Spa" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OUR COMMITMENT -->
    <section aria-labelledby="commitment-h">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Our Commitment</p>
          <h2 id="commitment-h">Care you can feel, technique you can trust.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="commitment-body reveal">
          <p>We work from the same set of ideas every visit: foot reflexology and TCM technique &mdash; acupressure, cupping, and moxibustion &mdash; applied with the pressure and pacing you actually need that day, not a fixed routine.</p>
          <p>Every therapist on our team is certified and trained in the modalities they practice. We hold ourselves to the same standard each time: a clean, quiet room, attentive care, and a session that leaves you feeling the difference &mdash; more balanced, less tense, ready for what's next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHAT WE OFFER -->
    <section class="offer" aria-labelledby="offer-h">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">What we offer</p>
          <h2 id="offer-h">Six ways to feel better.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="offer-list reveal">
          <li>TCM Therapy <span>acupressure, cupping &amp; rubbing</span></li>
          <li>Massage Therapy <span>full body</span></li>
          <li>Head Reflexology <span>scalp &amp; head</span></li>
          <li>Hand &amp; Foot Reflexology <span>most popular</span></li>
          <li>Chair Massage <span>head, neck, shoulder &amp; back</span></li>
          <li>Combination Foot &amp; Body Massage <span>two focuses, one session</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="offer-note reveal">Appointments are recommended for the best experience &mdash; walk-ins are welcome based on availability.</p>
        <div class="offer-cta reveal">
          <a class="btn btn-ember" href="/services">
            View Full Menu
            <span class="pip" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 8h8M8 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+18165233338">Call (816) 523-3338</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    /* ---------- Page intro (light band) ---------- */
    .hero {
      background: var(--hero-bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: calc(var(--step) + 3.2rem);
      padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }
    .hero .eyebrow { color: var(--ember); }
    .hero .lead { color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .body-copy { color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 1.1rem; max-width: 46ch; }

    .intro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); align-items: center; }
    .intro-photo {
      width: 100%; height: clamp(260px, 32vw, 420px);
      object-fit: cover; object-position: center 35%;
      border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: block;
    }

    /* ---------- Commitment ---------- */
    .commitment-body { display: grid; gap: 1.2rem; max-width: 68ch; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--ink); }
    .commitment-body p:first-child { color: var(--ink); }

    /* ---------- Offer ---------- */
    .offer { background: var(--surface); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .offer-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem) 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
    }
    .offer-list li {
      padding: 1.1rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-family: var(--f-display);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
    .offer-list li:nth-child(-n+2) { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
    .offer-list li span {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--f-mono);
      font-size: .74rem;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-top: .35rem;
    }
    .offer-note { margin-top: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .96rem; }
    .offer-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .9rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }

    /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .offer-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .offer-list li:nth-child(-n+2) { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .offer-list li:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
